WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.020
Hi, I'm Pathanda. I help you look for a program. I help you find a degree or certificate program

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:12.160
that fits your life and your schedule. For example, ask me, compare two teaching programs

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.540
for me side by side.
